  "description": "Where RAG means Road and Gravel, the X means Speed.\nWe took what is best in the RAG and made it racier, faster, snappier. XRAG is based on a tweaked frame with a more aggressive geometry, optimized for fast road/gravel rides and cyclocross racing.\nIt’s built for riders who want a lightweight, responsive drop-bar bike that handles sharp turns, accelerates instantly, and keeps its cool in rough race conditions.\nWant to race? Ride fast laps on local trails? Train in the off-season? The XRAG is your no-nonsense performance machine.\nXRAG vs RAG+:\n26mm+ shorter wheelbase\n1° steeper head angle\n15mm+ shorter headtube\nNew reach/stack ratio in all sizes\nSlightly lower BB for better stability\nBSA 73mm Bottom bracket\nFRAME\nTough and light alloy frame\nTECHNOLOGY\nThru-axles, 1x drivetrains, disc brakes, tubeless ready rims: everything that makes a true modern gravel bike rock!\nUNIQUE DESIGN\nUnique graphic design, hardcore heritage is in the DNA of all NS bikes - even if they have drop bars!",
